id: relay-choice
section: Proxies and certificates
item: The Riverstone Relay, when a user chooses it (never the default): the prefs go to the relay at once and an https site loads with its own certificate
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: about:settings
kit: cavekit-proxies-certs.md R2
needs: internet
wait rect page-title 20
calibrate page-title
tap 'sel:button.pane-tab[data-pane="advanced"]'
wait rect 'sel:button.pane-tab.on[data-pane="advanced"]' 5
wait rect 'sel:.row[data-pref="network.proxy.type"] select' 5
pick 'sel:.row[data-pref="network.proxy.type"] select' 2 7
wait pref s network.proxy.http proxy.riverstonerelay.org 5
launch https://example.com/ 60
calibrate 'sel:p'
expect text-has 'sel:p' documentation
